        <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
          <name>InformationDecoration2</name>
          <id>327</id>
          <title>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>Complete all wizard steps by performing the required actions. As you progress, marks will be set to the right of the steps. If any step is not planned to be completed, mark the step manually.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>همه مراحل دستیار را با انجام اقدامات لازم تکمیل کنید. با پیشرفت کار، علامت‌هایی در سمت راست مراحل قرار می‌گیرد. اگر قرار نیست مرحله‌ای تکمیل شود، آن را به‌صورت دستی علامت‌گذاری کنید.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>Необходимо пройти все шаги помощника, выполнив предусморенные в них действия. По мере прохождения, справа от шагов будут устанавливаться отметки. Если какой-то из шагов выполнять не планируется, необходимо установить отметку шага самостоятельно.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>Sihirbazın tüm adımlarını, içlerinde öngörülen işlemleri yaparak geçmek gerekir. Adımlar geçildikçe sağ tarafta işaretler kendiliğinden belirecektir. Herhangi bir adımı yapmayı planlamıyorsanız, adımın işaretini kendiniz koymanız gerekir.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>Complete all wizard steps by performing the required actions. As you progress, marks will be set to the right of the steps. If any step is not planned to be completed, mark the step manually.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>Complete all wizard steps by performing the required actions. As you progress, marks will be set to the right of the steps. If any step is not planned to be completed, mark the step manually.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>Complete all wizard steps by performing the required actions. As you progress, marks will be set to the right of the steps. If any step is not planned to be completed, mark the step manually.</value>
          </title>
          <visible>true</visible>
          <enabled>true</enabled>
          <userVisible>
            <common>true</common>
          </userVisible>
